title FIAP Hackathon — Fluxo de falha permanente da IA

Start [shape: oval, label: "analysis.requested\nrecebido pelo processing"]
Process [label: "ProcessAnalysisUseCase.execute()"]
Step1 [label: "Step 1: Gemini Vision\nextractComponents()"]
RetryGemini [shape: diamond, label: "retry < 3?"]
Step1Mock [label: "Fallback: MockProvider\nextractComponents()"]
Step2 [label: "Step 2: Groq Llama\nclassifyRisks()"]
RetryGroq [shape: diamond, label: "retry < 3?"]
Step2Mock [label: "Fallback: MockProvider\nclassifyRisks()"]
Persist [label: "INSERT analysis_results (Mongo)"]
PublishCompleted [shape: oval, label: "publish analysis.completed\ndegraded=true"]
PublishFailed [shape: oval, label: "publish analysis.failed\nreason ∈ {DOWNLOAD_FAILED,\nSCHEMA_VALIDATION_FAILED,\nAI_PROVIDER_EXHAUSTED,\nTIMEOUT, INTERNAL}"]
DLQ [shape: oval, label: "DLQ após 3 tentativas\n(alerta Datadog)"]

Start > Process
Process > Step1
Step1 > RetryGemini: erro Gemini (timeout/5xx)
RetryGemini > Step1: sim — exponential backoff
RetryGemini > Step1Mock: não (esgotou)
Step1Mock > Step2
Step1 > Step2: sucesso
Step2 > RetryGroq: erro Groq
RetryGroq > Step2: sim
RetryGroq > Step2Mock: não
Step2Mock > Persist
Step2 > Persist: sucesso
Persist > PublishCompleted
Process > PublishFailed: erro Zod (não-retentável) ou S3 GET falhou
PublishFailed > DLQ: SQS visibilityTimeout exceeded
